---
description: Stay In Touch stack and repo boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---

Stay In Touch is a private invite-only family app.

- Frontend in `web/`: Vite, React, TypeScript `strict`, React Aria Components, CSS Modules. No Tailwind or other utility CSS.
- Database in `supabase/`: Postgres, RLS, Auth, Realtime. Edge Functions live only in `supabase/functions/`.
- `api/` is reserved for a future FastAPI service. Do not add code there.
- Do not commit secrets, service-role keys, or the local demo password as if it were safe for production. `VITE_` variables are public.
- Folder map: `web/`, `supabase/`, `api/`, `docs/`, `.cursor/rules/`, `.github/workflows/`.
